r` value: InterfaceNotFound\nnote: run with `RUST_BACKTRACE=1` environment variable to display a backtrace\n\nHowever only on v4.5dev4.mono, the normal v4.5dev4 seems to not have this issue for whatever reason\n\nSpeculating somewhat but the error message refers to AccessKit 0.14.0, while at least the linux_builds.yaml for this repo refers to\n    repo: AccessKit/accesskit-c\n    version: tags/0.15.1\n    file: accesskit-c-0.15.1.zip\n    target: accesskit-c-0.15.1/accesskit_c.zip","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2903336530/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2904538502","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106242#issuecomment-2904538502","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106242","id":2904538502,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tH72G","user":{"login":"Fryker","id":92834204,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYiJnA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92834204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fryker","html_url":"https://github.com/Fryker","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fryker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fryker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fryker/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fryker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fryker/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fryker/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fryker/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fryker/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fryker/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05